+        "",
+        "Definitions.",
+        f"There are n={n} variables x0,...,x{n-1}; each variable is exactly 0 or 1.",
+        "All addition and multiplication are in F_2, so addition is XOR.",
+        "Each polynomial is reduced by x_i^2=x_i and uses this ordered basis:",
