codex
Rejected the family after full-paper audit.

The dense planted Boolean-MQ construction passes G and V, and local gates G1–G8 pass. However, it intrinsically fails G9(c): the cheapest measured algebraic attempt used 55,950 exact row XORs without finding a root, versus the 300-operation limit. The paper’s Theorem 2 gives only exponential BooleanSolve routes; there is no shorter Track B route for this conditioned-random distribution. See the [paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/1112.6263).

